  "bodyHash": "398a964bc407cc8d",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>元素苦力怕：Refabricated</strong> 是<a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/1275396-1-5-1-elemental-creepers-v3-2-1-daawwwwwww\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> xSmallDeadGuyx 制作的原始模组</a>的移植版，并在现代化改造中做了一些调整。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/r4SYiYl.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1428\" height=\"836\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">功能特性：</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">10+ 种苦力怕将生成在你的世界中，并带有各种特殊效果；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">可配置生成速率、爆炸半径，以及单独生成各类苦力怕的功能；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">元素TNT！击杀任意苦力怕后，你可能会获得对应元素的火药，可用于合成TNT，或还原为原版火药。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>苦力怕列表：</strong></span><br></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>水苦力怕：</strong>生成在海洋及其他水域相关生物群系附近。爆炸时会喷出水柱。<br><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>火苦力怕：</strong>生成在主世界炎热生物群系中，如沙漠、高原和热带草原。爆炸会在附近引燃火焰。<br><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>土苦力怕：</strong>爆炸后会留下一片泥土狼藉。小心不要在房子附近引爆它！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>风苦力怕：</strong>生成在山地区域。会将你高高抛向空中，记得带上水桶以防摔落受伤！<br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>雷苦力怕：</strong>爆炸时召唤一道闪电，可能使附近的苦力怕变为带电状态；<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br><strong>光苦力怕：</strong>生成荧石并赋予你发光效果；<br><br><strong>暗苦力怕</strong>：破坏大部分发光方块并赋予你失明效果；<br><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>冰苦力怕：</strong>生成在寒冷生物群系。经过时会留下雪层轨迹，冰苦力怕爆炸会产生大量积雪并赋予你缓慢效果。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"border:unset;display:unset;float:unset;text-transform:unset;text-indent:unset;text-align:unset;width:unset;text-decoration:unset\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252fxMWT7U\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://imgur.com/xMWT7U</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>岩浆苦力怕：</strong>仅在下界生成，岩浆苦力怕爆炸时会喷出熔岩柱，经过的地方会留下火焰痕迹。</span></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;<br></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>氢气苦力怕：</strong>爆炸威力如同普通苦力怕的十倍。千万别惹怒这只苦力怕！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>反转苦力怕：</strong>会将地面上下翻转。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>矿工苦力怕：</strong>会为你挖掘附近的石头（及其变种）。<br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>幻象苦力怕：</strong>会制造4个自身的幻象。真身会爆炸，而那4个分身则试图迷惑你。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>烟花苦力怕：</strong>会生成一个烟花 :D……但别靠它爆炸太近！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>曲奇苦力怕：</strong>爆炸不会造成伤害或破坏方块，之后会掉落2-4个曲奇。<br><br><strong>彩虹苦力怕：</strong>极为稀有，爆炸时会随机触发上述任意一种苦力怕的效果。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br>常见问题</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">你获得原作者制作此模组的授权了吗？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>答：</strong> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fcD4Mo1v.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">是的，我获得了授权。</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">什么时候移植到 Forge/回退到 <em>[过时版本]</em>？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>答：</strong> <span style=\"font-size:8px\">不会</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果发现任何漏洞或Bug，请在 <a href=\"https://github.com/Luligabi1/ElementalCreepersRefabricated\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 仓库</a> 或 Discord 服务器上报反馈：<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fG4PjhEf\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/707435077679841350/embed.png?style=banner2&v=2\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"76\"> </a></p>",
